  <wpt lat="50.31667037205799" lon="-122.78385389971402">
    <name>Route Alternative</name>
    <cmt>control</cmt>
    <desc>Riders who want to take a more direct route to Lilloeet can follow this route on the paved Duffy Lake Road (Hwy 99) all the way to Lillooet. There are a few camping options along the way. Expect moderate traffic and not the greatest shoulder. There is also a significant climb with some steep grades. Not as scenic as the route to Lilloeet via Mission Pass. </desc>
