    <name>Camping Area</name>
    <cmt>camping</cmt>
    <desc>Free camping area with gazebo, pit toilets and tables. Very nice. Location is exactly where this camping symbol is. You turn left on the dirt road before crossing the bridge/rail tracks into town. There are also metal containers at the cabins where you can safely stash your food overnight. A little further up from the camping area is a powerful waterfall. </desc>
